    "gaps": [
      "Specialization requires at most 4096 selected Lean rows. The adapter rejects larger selections before traversal; exactly 4096 completes normally.",
      "Fixed hub arguments exclude snapshot-only mode, retained in the source and registered snapshot interface. The executable graph specializes this unreachable branch and uses a verified empty-state pass-through so the top-level Lunar loop performs zero native checks for empty selection. Strict and optional publication paths remain source-owned.",
      "Hub preflight, dry-run and outer repository write auditing remain the invoking native hub boundary; these step tools authorize writes and retain owned state.",
      "The 3600s and operation-call limits remain normalization metadata; native hub subprocess timeout is 900s. Runtime receipts do not imply scientific acceptance.",
      "External effects remain subject to native dependency and compiler capabilities; deterministic fixtures qualify orchestration only."
    ]
  },
